This probes designing a CKNE-driven feature rollout that balances safety with dynamic per-tenant exposure.

## Key Concepts
- CKNE-to-rollout mapping and ramping
- Per-tenant traffic-splitting and rollback budgets
- SLA guards: latency, error-rate, and rollback triggers

## Code Example
